old, only trigger i.e. &amp;lt;50. As long as it falls below the threshold send triggers, need not be by&amp;nbsp; quarter, but we should update the quarter to automatically update when the date reaches&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
